    "message": "[ipa-delivery:750] build the private test IPA 750: S2Arm engine patch 0037 (black blocks, half-written reads) and session 02's app fixes, on base 749\n\nFrozen manifest 750: the verified IPA 749 product with the S2Arm engine\nof patches 0001-0037 (run 43678703943, artifact 14147119775, verified pin\nfafd8365). Patch 0037 takes three later S2Arm fixes unmodified: the\nsame-pass attachment snapshot on all 256 slots, the cross-queue buffer\nlifetime and the mesh attribute readback. Session 02's app commits are\nincluded: RetroArch skin hidden with a controller, box pictures kept\nacross installs, lighter games list and carousel, idle decorations and\npreview video stopped. RPCS3 Core 938, MeloNX Core 030cc14f, XeniaCore and\nevery retained component are those of the base. Images that must change:\nApp, S2ArmEngine, libretro_internal_bridge and Runner. Build-only\ndelivery: Flutter/native groups not-run. Nothing has run on an iPhone; no\nframe rate, stability or heat claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-15T05:10:40Z",
